stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> AwaitingCatchUp
  AwaitingCatchUp --> Ready: target reaches the barrier
  Ready --> Committing: the commit is claimed under the plan lock
  Committing --> Ready: refused before consensus saw the command
  Committing --> Committed: commit mints the epoch and records the audit
  AwaitingCatchUp --> Cancelled: operator cancels
  Ready --> Cancelled: operator cancels
  Committed --> [*]
  Cancelled --> [*]
